On Thu, 24 Jan 2008, Lipor wrote:

> Is this possible to edit the save file to undo the "Ctrl X Explore Mode"
> info on it.

You can edit the source code such that the restore function sets the
explore mode flag to "false" when restoring a game (look in restgamestate
in restore.c).

> I just think editing the savefile wouldn't be cheating, or not?

If you have not used any of the advantages of explore mode, then I would
not classify it as cheating; but in any case, it's up to you to play
however you enjoy the game.

